 \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Brings clarity to the work agents produce and allows working at a higher level of abstraction\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Google Workspace Plugins\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor now supports plugins for Google Drive (search files, create/organize files), Gmail (search, read, draft, send messages), and Google Calendar (read schedules, create events).\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-13\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Cursor for iPad with Full PR Review Surface\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor for iPad is now available on all paid plans with a full review surface covering comments, checks, and approvals, inbox organization, and Bitbucket/Azure DevOps SCM support.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-13\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Cursor Router: Intelligent Model Routing\",\n    \"description\": \"Auto mode is now powered by Cursor Router, an intelligent model router that analyzes requests and sends them to the appropriate model with Intelligence, Balance, and Cost optimization modes.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-13\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    \"title\": \"Devin Coach Suggestions in Input Box\",\n    \"description\": \"Introducing Devin Coach, a new feature that surfaces suggestions directly in the session input box as you write, helping you improve prompts before sending.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    \"title\": \"Grok 4.6 Integration\",\n    \"description\": \"Grok 4.6 is now live in both Devin Desktop and the Devin CLI, marked as a significant improvement over Grok 4.5 on FrontierCode 1.1. Grok 4.6 surpasses GPT-5.6 Sol on Devin's coding benchmark.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-12\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Grok 4.6 surpasses GPT-5.6 Sol and ranks behind only Opus 5 and Fable 5 on Devin's coding benchmark\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Shows particular strength on thorough code exploration and root cause analysis before touching any code\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Grok 4.6 is asking for writing feedback specifically on Twitter/X\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"v0.55.1 Stable Release - August 11, 2026\",\n    \"description\": \"Latest stable release of Gemini CLI with tool registry discovery, enhanced release verification, CI stability improvements, and stronger security/sandbox protections.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-11\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"v0.54.0 Stable Release - August 6, 2026\",\n    \"description\": \"Gemini CLI v0.54.0 with reliability fixes addressing Termux relaunch issues and improved session management.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]\n",
